  about:{kind:'company',eyebrow:'ABOUT HEXAMATICS GROUP',title:'One partner for running in Asia. Since 2002.',intro:'Hexa designs, builds and runs operations in Asia. We employ your people, give them an office and a compliant entity to work under, and run the administration behind them. You direct the work. We own the rest.',stats:[['2002','founded'],['7','Asian markets, own entities in each'],['50+','blue-chip clients'],['150+','engagements delivered'],['53','regional full-time staff']],cards:[['Design','Advisory and automation: the operation designed first, delivered at scale, run on tools we build.'],['Build','Workforce and business support: compliant teams, an entity to work under, an office to work in.'],['Run','Operations: payroll, compliance, finance and admin handled day to day, in every market.'],['Where we are','Headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, with our own entities and teams in seven markets covering over 575 million people.']],sections:[['Our story','Founded in Malaysia in 2002 and founder-led ever since, Hexa grew one market at a time: Singapore and the Philippines in 2012, Myanmar in 2014, Indonesia in 2016, Vietnam in 2018 and Nepal in 2022.'],['Why one partner','Companies rarely fail in Asia for lack of opportunity. They fail on the basics: an entity that takes months to register, a licence nobody tracked, a team with no one allowed to sign a contract. We are already there. The entities exist, the teams exist, the licences are held.'],['Who we work with','Clients past and present include Ericsson, Nokia, IBM, Accenture, Maybank, CIMB, GSK, Novartis and Panasonic, across telecoms, technology, banking, pharma, manufacturing and e-commerce. Government and regulated clients are described, not named.'],['Our commitment','Start where you are stuck. We map what it takes in each market, what it will cost locally and how fast it can happen, before you commit to anything. If you go ahead, we build it and run it.']]},
  contact:{kind:'contact',eyebrow:'THE FIRST STEP',title:'Start where you are stuck.',intro:'A market you have committed to and cannot yet operate in. A team that has to exist by a date. A programme with no one on the ground to run it. Tell us where it is stuck and by when. We map what it takes, what it will cost locally and how fast it can happen, before you commit to anything.',cards:[['Email','hello@hexamatics.com'],['Headquarters','Jaya One, Petaling Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia'],['Before you commit','We map what it takes in each market and how fast it can happen.']]},
